  "contract": [
    "Six dungeon floors plus the public office. Four new floors have separate compartments reached from other floors.",
    "No stair-only path reaches Ada or the relay. Before the card, A/B reach Ada; C/D form a misleading but useful alternate loop.",
    "H returns from Ada to a sealed pocket on the earlier operations floor. The card opens a new exit from that pocket.",
    "After the card, six persistent doors open optional recovery, the second captive, supplies, and three distinct approaches to relay access.",
    "All eight panel pairs are bidirectional and safe arrivals are distinct from active tiles. No forced one-way softlocks.",
    "The physical holding circuit, Reed battle, enforcer battle and Ellis release remain separate. No paper awards progression."
  ]
